WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.312
Welcome to the Econ SME orientation.

00:00:03.312 --> 00:00:06.850
Review Macro PLI evidence, then approve, override,

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:10.250
or send it back without changing the deterministic source record

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:10.425
.

00:00:10.425 --> 00:00:13.762
Treat every queue item as a bounded specialist review.

00:00:13.762 --> 00:00:16.950
Confirm the source record and dependency state, inspect the

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:20.925
complete worksheet or handoff, use the explicit specialist control

00:00:20.925 --> 00:00:23.512
, and verify the resulting queue state.

00:00:23.512 --> 00:00:26.075
Your decision becomes evidence for White Cell;

00:00:26.075 --> 00:00:29.050
it does not replace White Cell’s operational role.
